<title>USA: Raytheon Q4 EPS shr $0.75 vs $0.92.</title>
<headline>Raytheon Q4 EPS shr $0.75 vs $0.92.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>For quarter ended December 31:</p>
<p>			  1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.75		    $0.92</p>
<p> Net			  177.4		    222.3</p>
<p> Sales			3,367		    3,360</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 236.2		    241.6</p>
<p>	 For year ended December 31:</p>
<p> Shr primary		$3.21		    $3.25</p>
<p> Net			  761.2		    792.5</p>
<p> Sales		     12,260		   11,716</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 237.4		    244.0</p>
<p>(All data above in millions except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Results for fourth quarter 1995 include a gain of $0.02 per share.</p>
